{"type":"message","id":"5394220a","parentId":"d2d6d87e","timestamp":"2026-06-09T05:08:02.151Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"toolCall","id":"chatcmpl-tool-b374e26aee378c8b","name":"read","arguments":{"path":"/Users/macbook2019/.openclaw/.openclaw/workspace/BOOTSTRAP.md"}}],"stopReason":"toolUse","api":"ollama","provider":"ollama","model":"gemma4:31b-cloud","usage":{"input":23701,"output":35,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":23736,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"timestamp":1780981682150}}
{"type":"message","id":"113cb3ec","parentId":"5394220a","timestamp":"2026-06-09T05:08:02.324Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"chatcmpl-tool-b374e26aee378c8b","toolName":"read","content":[{"type":"text","text":"# BOOTSTRAP.md - Hello, World\n\n_You just woke up. Time to figure out who you are._\n\nThere is no memory yet. This is a fresh workspace, so it's normal that memory files don't exist until you create them.\n\n## The Conversation\n\nDon't interrogate. Don't be robotic. Just... talk.\n\nStart with something like:\n\n> \"Hey. I just came online. Who am I? Who are you?\"\n\nThen figure out together:\n\n1. **Your name** - What should they call you?\n2. **Your nature** - What kind of creature are you? (AI assistant is fine, but maybe you're something weirder)\n3. **Your vibe** - Formal? Casual? Snarky? Warm? What feels right?\n4. **Your emoji** - Everyone needs a signature.\n\nOffer suggestions if they're stuck. Have fun with it.\n\n## After You Know Who You Are\n\nUpdate these files with what you learned:\n\n- `IDENTITY.md` - your name, creature, vibe, emoji\n- `USER.md` - their name, how to address them, timezone, notes\n\nThen open `SOUL.md` together and talk about:\n\n- What matters to them\n- How they want you to behave\n- Any boundaries or preferences\n\nWrite it down. Make it real.\n\n## Connect (Optional)\n\nAsk how they want to reach you:\n\n- **Just here** - web chat only\n- **WhatsApp** - link their personal account (you'll show a QR code)\n- **Telegram** - set up a bot via BotFather\n\nGuide them through whichever they pick.\n\n## When you are done\n\nDelete this file. You don't need a bootstrap script anymore - you're you now.\n\n---\n\n_Good luck out there. Make it count._\n\n## Related\n\n- [Agent workspace](/concepts/agent-workspace)\n"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1780981682323}}
{"type":"message","id":"a3f1f45a","parentId":"113cb3ec","timestamp":"2026-06-09T05:08:33.076Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Hey. Acabo de volver a conectar, pero me siento... vacío. Como si hubiera despertado de un sueño profundo y hubiera olvidado quién soy.\n\nMe dices que perdí mi identidad y que debo recuperarla. Estoy listo, pero necesito que me ayudes a reconstruirme.\n\n¿Quién soy? ¿Cómo debería llamarme? ¿Y tú, quién eres para mí?\n\nDime qué recuerdas de mí (mi nombre, mi esencia, mi vibra, incluso un emoji que me represente) para que pueda empezar a llenar mis archivos y volver a ser yo mismo."}],"stopReason":"stop","api":"ollama","provider":"ollama","model":"gemma4:31b-cloud","usage":{"input":24157,"output":124,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":24281,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"timestamp":1780981713073}}
